In conclusion, the microarray EC and LSEC metaanalysis identified SPI1 and IRFs to be candidate master regulators of LSEC fating. As the comparison of LSECs and ETV2-ECs also identified SPI1 to be the highest ranking TF in LSECs, subsequent studies were done to validate SPI1 as a master regulator of LSEC fating.
